flowchart TB
    classDef root fill:#7B42BC,stroke:#4C1D95,color:#fff
    classDef mod fill:#EDE9FE,stroke:#7C3AED,color:#2E1065
    classDef cfg fill:#FEF3C7,stroke:#D97706,color:#451A03
    classDef boot fill:#DCFCE7,stroke:#16A34A,color:#052e16
    classDef st fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#6B7280,color:#111

    subgraph BOOT["infra/bootstrap (applied once · local state)"]
        B1["aws_s3_bucket.tfstate<br/>versioned · KMS · TLS-only"]:::boot
        B2["aws_ecr_repository.api<br/>immutable · scan on push"]:::boot
        B3["CI users + roles + policies<br/>plan / deploy"]:::boot
    end

    subgraph ENVS["infra/envs (values only)"]
        DEVV["dev/terraform.tfvars<br/>dev/backend.hcl → key envs/dev/…"]:::cfg
        PRDV["prod/terraform.tfvars<br/>prod/backend.hcl → key envs/prod/…"]:::cfg
    end

    STACK["infra/stack (composition root)<br/>providers: aws · aws.us_east_1 · aws.copy_region · random<br/>default_tags: Project Environment Owner ManagedBy Repository CostCenter<br/>random_password.origin_verify · data.aws_ecr_repository"]:::root

    KMS["module kms<br/>CMK + alias + key policy"]:::mod
    NET["module network<br/>VPC · 3 tiers × AZs · RTs · NAT toggle<br/>S3 endpoint · flow logs"]:::mod
    SEC["module security<br/>SG alb / app / db + rules"]:::mod
    DBM["module database<br/>subnet group · param group · RDS"]:::mod
    COMP["module compute<br/>cluster · log group · IAM · task def<br/>internal ALB · TG · listener · service · autoscaling"]:::mod
    CDN["module cdn<br/>S3 · OAC · VPC origin · distribution · WAF"]:::mod
    MON["module monitoring<br/>SNS · alarms · metric filter · EventBridge · dashboard"]:::mod
    BAK["module backup<br/>KMS · vault · lock · plan · selection · DR vault"]:::mod

    STATE[("S3 state<br/>envs/dev/terraform.tfstate<br/>envs/prod/terraform.tfstate")]:::st

    B1 -.->|stores| STATE
    B2 -.->|"data source: repository_url"| STACK
    DEVV & PRDV -->|"-var-file / -backend-config"| STACK
    STACK --> KMS & NET
    NET -->|vpc_id| SEC
    KMS -->|key_arn| NET & DBM & COMP & MON
    NET -->|data_subnet_ids| DBM
    SEC -->|db_sg_id| DBM
    NET -->|"private/public subnet ids, has_nat"| COMP
    SEC -->|"alb_sg_id, app_sg_id"| COMP
    DBM -->|"address, port, secret_arn"| COMP
    COMP -->|"alb_arn, alb_dns_name"| CDN
    COMP -->|"alb/tg suffix, cluster, service, log group"| MON
    DBM -->|instance_id| MON
    STACK --> BAK
    DBM -.->|"tag backup=true"| BAK
    STACK -.-> STATE
